# Song of Freyalise: chapter I gives the creatures Bot1 controls as it resolves "{T}: Add one mana of any color" until
# Bot1's next turn (CR 611.2b), so the Gorilla taps for blue on turn 3 and, once turn 5 begins, no longer can: the
# grant ended with that turn, before chapter II could renew it. Chapter III (turn 7) puts a +1/+1 counter on each
# creature Bot1 controls, which gain vigilance, trample and indestructible until end of turn.

